WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.780
Fight, crash through, and face the challenge!

3
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.000
These are our hard knock days.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.830
Can't quench our thirst with a peaceful, everyday life.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.340
Here we go - don't ever run away!

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.450
Let's go on living as the mighty winds take us!

7
00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.870
We've still got so far to go.

8
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.390
Gotta keep going through the hard knock days.

9
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.610
Let's do it again, yes, baby. How many times

10
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.110
do I have to stand back up to make my dream come true?

11
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.730
Feels like the strength of my resolve

12
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.200
is put to the test everyday.

13
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.700
Hey, let's go!

14
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.450
I don't want to make excuses and settle for being mediocre.

15
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.900
Hey, let's go!

16
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.670
We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.

17
00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:54.110
As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.

18
00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:59.370
Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,

19
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.220
Oh!

20
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.500
Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,

21
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.450
will we have the last laugh, be the winners!

22
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.120
We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!

23
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.630
Fight, shake it off, act strong!

24
00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:15.630
These are our hard knock days.

25
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.680
There's no such thing as a safe choice.

26
00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.890
Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!

27
00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:27.270
Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.

28
00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.860
Let's put our wishes all together,

29
00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.650
and keep on going through the hard knock days.

30
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:51.760
<b>Dressrosa - South Shore</b>

31
00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:50.930
Three days after the battle between the Straw Hats and the Donquixote Family...

32
00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:03.000
Is Straw Hat Luffy still here in this country?

33
00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.530
Confirmed, ma'am. He's badly wounded.

34
00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:08.600
I see.

35
00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:14.300
<b>Soldier-san's Conviction</b>

36
00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.030
Isshou, I heard what you did!

37
00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:22.410
<b>Navy Headquarters Inspector General
Sengoku the Buddha</b>

38
00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.410
The prostration and that spat with Sakazuki!

39
00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.450
I'm glad I'm not fleet admiral anymore!

40
00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:29.200
Cut it out, you expired rice cracker.

41
00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:32.190
<b>Navy Headquarters Vice Admiral
Great Advisor Tsuru</b>

42
00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:32.130
It must be nice to be an inspector general with barely any responsibilities.

43
00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:36.210
Admiral Fujitora,
why haven't you apprehended that pirate?

44
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.260
You know where Straw Hat's hiding, do you not?

45
00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:45.100
"The gravely-wounded pirate
who saved the country."

46
00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:48.640
Should I consider him an enemy?

47
00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:52.520
Or ought I let him go,
being that he's a hero to this country?

48
00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:56.230
I can't quite decide for myself.

49
00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.170
A die?

50
00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.480
This is no laughing matter!

51
00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:11.870
A die!

52
00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:14.970
That's enough from you!

53
00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:16.300
Oh, how scary.

54
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:17.990
My word!

55
00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:20.510
You've been using that to decide?

56
00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.140
Still, Tsuru-san...

57
00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:26.070
If he is merely some ordinary person,

58
00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:29.100
would he have been saved by providence two days in a row?

59
00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.580
Today marks the third day, and I haven't been cheating.

60
00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.800
You! I want soba noodles, too.

61
00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.610
Aye aye, sir! Coming right up, sir!

62
00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:46.960
I thank you for assisting with the transportation of the Celestial Yaksha.

63
00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:50.120
However, I'm still in charge here.

64
00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.210
So you'll allow me to handle this situation as I see fit.

65
00:03:55.570 --> 00:04:02.820
Right, but the Navy can't leave a pirate
with a bounty at large forever.

66
00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:05.050
Please become Dande-donors!

67
00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.180
People of the Navy, please become Dande-donors!

68
00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.230
Ah, you're here again today.

69
00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:12.850
Yes, I am.

70
00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:15.580
Oh my, look how cute she is!

71
00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.460
If it isn't a dwarf!

72
00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:26.750
I'm Mansherry from the Tontatta Tribe!

73
00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:29.620
She's cute!

74
00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.370
Oh, how rare!

75
00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:38.130
Ouch! Wh-What the...

76
00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.010
Show due respect, you lot!

77
00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.690
Princess Mansherry is the Tonta Chief's daughter!

78
00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.490
She's a princess!

79
00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:48.700
Why aren't you bowing your heads?!

80
00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:50.600
It's fine, Mousey.

81
00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.430
Oh, how merciful she is!

82
00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:57.310
To tell you the truth,
we mustn't show ourselves in Dressrosa...

83
00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:01.070
to anyone but members of the royal family.

84
00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:05.560
So I wanted to heal everybody's wounds without being seen.

85
00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.780
Hmm, but how?

86
00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:17.560
<b>Town Center</b>

87
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.780
The time has come!

88
00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.360
Yeah! I've been waiting for this moment!

89
00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:17.540
Me too!

90
00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.240
Take it away, Gatz!

91
00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.630
Gatz!

92
00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:25.610
Dear ladies and gentlemen!

93
00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:28.890
Today, our dream will finally come true!

94
00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:36.140
For on this very day, the king shall return!

95
00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:45.070
That's right! After a decade,
King Riku will announce...

96
00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.610
his return to the throne today!

97
00:05:51.560 --> 00:06:06.010
King Riku! King Riku! King Riku! King Riku!

98
00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:09.090
The entire nation is excited.

99
00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:13.390
They were fooled by a pirate,
held a grudge against their king,

100
00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:18.060
and praised wealth and violence at one point.

101
00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.150
But ever since they came face-to-face with death,

102
00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.860
they now wish with all their hearts for a peaceful country.

103
00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:30.050
It's absolutely absurd, but I can't laugh at it.

104
00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:35.310
No one would find that funny.
I'm truly happy that they survived.

105
00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:42.460
But will I be able to make them happy?

106
00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:04.190
I wish I could become an omnipotent king,
capable of fending off even natural disasters.

107
00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.650
Come now! Don't get too ahead of yourself!

108
00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:09.950
I'm kidding!

109
00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:17.020
We'll continue on as we have before.
What else are we to do?

110
00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.770
You're right.

111
00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:27.510
Until the day Rebecca inherits the throne...

112
00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:37.470
Never mind that. Are you sure about this?

113
00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:44.060
I remember how stubborn Scarlett was when she was young.

114
00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.700
Rebecca will follow in her footsteps before long, I'm sure.

115
00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.360
What do you mean by that?

116
00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:55.180
<b>Inside the
Palace</b>

117
00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:02.830
There! You're all set.

118
00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.770
Oh, how lovely!

119
00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:08.070
Indeed, girls look better in dresses than armor!

120
00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:09.460
You think so?

121
00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:12.380
You look incredible, Rebecca-sama!

122
00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.620
Thank you.

123
00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:18.100
When you wear that dress,
you look exactly like Scarlett-sama!

124
00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.690
Oh yes, we've heard about your father!

125
00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:31.690
They say that Scarlett-sama ran away
with a prince of a far-off foreign land.

126
00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:37.280
And that left King Riku no choice
but to announce that she was dead.

127
00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.530
It's like something out of a romance novel!

128
00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.100
I can only dream about it!

129
00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.650
<b>City Center</b>

130
00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:56.140
A prince from where?

131
00:08:56.460 --> 00:09:01.430
I heard he was from a lush country with beautiful lakes.

132
00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:05.290
But the country was in a war at that time.

133
00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:11.280
She fell for someone she shouldn't have
and had a baby. That was Rebecca.

134
00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.560
Eh?

135
00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:18.500
But sadly, the prince died in the war and...

136
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:23.180
Scarlett-sama and Rebecca-
I mean, Rebecca-sama, were left behind,

137
00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:25.660
so they were living in hiding in this country.

138
00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:30.220
I see. So she only has pure noble blood in her veins.

139
00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.780
Quite the odd rumor.

140
00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:37.070
Kyros-dono is the father of Rebecca-dono, is he not?

141
00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:40.370
Hm, I know not.
Do you want some lettuce?

142
00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.220
No thank you.

143
00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:49.860
Soldier-san is valiant...

144
00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:54.990
and he will always watch over you!

145
00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:07.290
Soldier

146
00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.050
Hooray!

147
00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:21.220
Ah, they are distributing
Mansherry-dono's medicinal flowers!

148
00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:24.890
Such wonderful things!
She is doing an excellent job today as well.

149
00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.790
Get in line and wait your turn, please.

150
00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:28.980
One per person!

151
00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:30.450
Thank you.

152
00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.800
This medication works really well!
It heals wounds instantly!

153
00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.430
Here.

154
00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:39.360
Thank you!

155
00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:43.660
Dad! I got one for you!

156
00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.090
Today, I'll use this one for the wound on my head.

157
00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:55.230
Wow! It healed completely!

158
00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:56.420
It's like magic!

159
00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.280
I'm so grateful!

160
00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:07.160
<b>Navy Camp</b>

161
00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:24.300
Here.

162
00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:24.950
Here ya go.

163
00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:29.210
Thank you!

164
00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.750
So cute!

165
00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:35.590
I see. We can donate our healing properties like giving blood.

166
00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:38.710
What a wonderful ability granted by the Heal-Heal Fruit.

167
00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:42.050
Alright, take some from me, too!

168
00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:45.140
You'll get enough to cure ten heavily-injured people!

169
00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.640
Oh, we can always count on you!

170
00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.390
Then, I'll donate enough for fifteen people!

171
00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.640
What's that?

172
00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.050
Then, I'll donate enough for twenty people!

173
00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:56.410
I'll donate enough for twenty-five people!

174
00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:57.570
Alright already!

175
00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:58.780
Enough for a hundred people, then!

176
00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.660
Thank you, but I don't think that's possible.

177
00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.540
Tsuru-san.

178
00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:14.140
Would you do me the honor of rolling today?

179
00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:24.860
If it is anything other than "one,"
we shall go after Straw Hat and Law at once.

180
00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:33.330
<b>Kyros' House</b>

181
00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:33.350
Sorry to have kept you waiting!

182
00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.980
Food?!

183
00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:51.250
My, my... and they all kept
mentioning how Rebecca-dono's father...

184
00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:54.050
is a prince of some country.

185
00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:54.910
Aye?

186
00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:56.040
Aye.

187
00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:01.340
What's that all about?
That's a weird story!

188
00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.990
And I'm sad because
Sabo's gone!

189
00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:09.710
We gotta hurry

190
00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:12.640
and catch up with

191
00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:12.640
Sanji's group, too!

192
00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:18.440
Be mad, cry, hurry, sleep, or eat!

193
00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:19.480
Just pick one!

194
00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.400
So damned irritating!

195
00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:24.880
Rebecca's father is the old soldier-

196
00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.120
You're not fully recovered!

197
00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.830
Quit being a pig and go back to sleep!

198
00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.960
Just who the hell
made up that lie?!

199
00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:40.340
I started the rumor.

200
00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:50.030
The only people who know about Rebecca's birth are some people in the royal family,

201
00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:52.520
and some people in the
Donquixote Family.

202
00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:57.040
Countrywide, people only know of her mother.

203
00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.740
I started the rumor before they could find out I was her father.

204
00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:08.110
Why?

205
00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.120
I have a criminal record.

206
00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.620
I was ill-bred, too.

207
00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:19.440
I was never worthy of marrying into the royal family.

208
00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:21.740
And that's why...

209
00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:25.300
This is how it should be.

210
00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:27.930
No it ain't!

211
00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.740
Does Rebecca know that?!

212
00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.180
She must've received the letter by now.

213
00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:39.560
I wrote the truth about everything I've done in my life.

214
00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:44.460
I've caused her suffering for a long time.

215
00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.540
I want her to cut her connections to people like me,

216
00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:52.070
and live happily ever after, openly.

217
00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:55.950
That's the only way I can make it up to her as a father.

218
00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:01.500
I'm thinking about leaving this country when you guys do.

219
00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.000
Rebecca's still a child.

220
00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.020
I don't want her to ruin her chance at being happy by being caught up in the moment!

221
00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.660
I've also convinced his majesty!

222
00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.810
He's so not okay with this...

223
00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:34.580
What now?

224
00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:37.430
Commander!

225
00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:39.710
Uh, I mean, Kyros-sama! Leo here!

226
00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:41.620
Zoro-senpai!

227
00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:46.940
Oh, Luffy-senpai! You've awoken!

228
00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.170
Good morning!

229
00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.930
When five members of the Straw Hats are gathered,

230
00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:01.550
they're too bright to even gaze upon!

231
00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:04.500
It's like a laser beam of epicness!

232
00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:12.150
If I see all the stars of the
Straw Hats someday, I'll turn to dust!

233
00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:14.450
Just spit out what you're here for already!

234
00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:15.990
Oh, yeah!

235
00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.260
There's a lotta commotion at the Navy camp!

236
00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.340
They're gonna be here any minute!

237
00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:26.580
The Great Advisor, Vice Admiral Tsuru,
and the former Fleet Admiral, Sengoku, have arrived!

238
00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.090
Tsuru and Sengoku?!

239
00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:31.510
What are those heavyweights doing here?!
They need to get lost!

240
00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.760
Sengoku...

241
00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:36.350
Leo, what did you call me for?

242
00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:39.350
Oh, the Navy is making their move right now!

243
00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.360
It's a six.

244
00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.670
And so heaven wills it!

245
00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:54.970
All naval units!
Apprehend the Straw Hats, Trafalgar Law,

246
00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:59.910
and all felons hidden at the Palace at once!

247
00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.330
Yes, sir!

248
00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:10.800
Admiral! Do we have permission to enter the Palace, sir?

249
00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:15.180
You needn't worry about anything.
I will take full responsibility!

250
00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:16.300
Roger!

251
00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:49.130
The Navy's on the move. Hurry up and get ready!

252
00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.710
They're finally coming for us!

253
00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.270
You need not tell us that.

254
00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:56.950
We have been prepared to escape at a moment's notice.

255
00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:59.690
We were merely waiting for Luffy-dono to awaken.

256
00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:05.170
Aye, if anything, I am baffled as to why they have not yet attempted to apprehend us.

257
00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:08.410
But we have a problem. We are without a vessel.

258
00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:10.670
You're right!

259
00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:13.270
Where're we gonna find a ship so we can escape?!

260
00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:15.440
Leo, did you do what I asked of you?

261
00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:19.030
Absolutely. I did everything you asked.

262
00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.650
It's dangerous here! Stay out of our way!

263
00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:24.540
We're in pursuit of pirates!

264
00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.870
Clear the way!

265
00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.210
Huh? They're after Lucy, too?!

266
00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.080
No way...

267
00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:34.170
Rooster-san, they look like they're headed to the Palace as well!

268
00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.200
The warriors are in danger!

269
00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:39.500
Gotcha! Thanks for lookin' out for us, little guy!

270
00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:43.660
We've been keepin' an eye on
the Navy the whole time ourselves.

271
00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:46.680
Luffy-senpai and the rest of you, I'll lead the way!

272
00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.900
Run straight to the eastern port!

273
00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:51.990
Don't worry!

274
00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:56.810
Our allies've been standing by
at strategic points for quite a while,

275
00:18:56.810 --> 00:19:01.490
to help y'all to escape from this country
whenever you woke up!

276
00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.960
We'll clear the way for ya!

277
00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:09.280
We have a ship for you at the east port!

278
00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:11.560
Thanks tons!

279
00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:15.710
We let Nami and the others take the Sunny, so we didn't know what to do.

280
00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.780
Aww, don't mention it!

281
00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:24.010
We all fought together as a team!

282
00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:27.780
We can't let 'em capture our king now!

283
00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.640
Bellamy! Can you get up?

284
00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:39.320
Yeah. I can even run.

285
00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.700
Okay, that's good.

286
00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:47.220
Trafalgar, why didn't you leave me to my fate?

287
00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:50.970
That place was supposed to be my deathbed.

288
00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:54.960
Straw Hatter insisted you were his friend, so I brought you along, just in case.

289
00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.550
Feel free to die here if you want.

290
00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:01.200
I've fully recovered, thanks to that dwarf.

291
00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.680
Why do I have to die fighting the Navy?!

292
00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:07.900
Just find some way to die, idiot.

293
00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.350
The hell did you say?!

294
00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.660
You haven't even thanked me.

295
00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:20.940
Hey, hey now! We don't have time to think!

296
00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.860
Let's just get running, my comrades in arms!

297
00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.880
Alright, let's go!

298
00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:26.990
They're leaving!

299
00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:29.240
Capture every last one of them!

300
00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.400
Open fire!

301
00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.810
Oops! Let me handle this!

302
00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:39.920
Barrier!

303
00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:45.210
Don't stop! Fire, fire, fire!

304
00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:47.470
Okay, this way, everybody!

305
00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:52.120
You'll be in deep trouble if you run into Fujitora!

306
00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:54.700
Whatever you do, don't get separated!

307
00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:08.330
Huh? Luffy-senpai?!

308
00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.330
There's something I've gotta do, so just go on ahead!

309
00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:14.360
What?!

310
00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:16.550
Luffy, we don't have much time!

311
00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:19.050
Do what you gotta do, but do it fast!

312
00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:20.750
We'll be waiting at the eastern port!

313
00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:21.790
Got it!

314
00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:22.770
Let's hurry!

315
00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:25.630
Zoro-senpai, you're heading south!

316
00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.050
But even that aspect of you is so cool!

317
00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:29.930
Huh? Lucy?!

318
00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:33.480
Yes, he's being chased by marines.
I suppose he'll be setting sail soon.

319
00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:38.240
Oh no... I haven't even thanked him properly!

320
00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:47.530
Shall we see if he's run out of luck?

321
00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:54.260
Let's put it to the test...

322
00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:56.710
with all my might!

323
00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:02.460
Going forward, I'm assuming command of all units...

324
00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.800
on behalf of Isshou-san!

325
00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:09.400
<b>Naval tent near
the center of
Dressrosa</b>

326
00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:09.810
Continue pursuit of the criminals that were hidden at the Palace!

327
00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:10.220
Yes, sir!

328
00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:14.560
How are we faring with Straw Hat's party on the hill in Carta?

329
00:22:15.120 --> 00:22:17.230
Hey, this way, everybody!

330
00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:25.490
Sogeking-senpai!

331
00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:27.560
Even when you trip and fall, you look so cool!

332
00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:33.410
Is it really safe to run through town like this?!

333
00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:36.960
Don't worry! Let's hurry up!

334
00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:39.770
We're currently chasing after the pirates!

335
00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:42.820
They appear to be heading toward the eastern port!

336
00:22:42.820 --> 00:22:45.960
Very well. Put me through to the eastern port!

337
00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:51.180
Yes, this is the Navy lookout unit at the eastern port, over!

338
00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:56.180
Nothing to report, over!

339
00:22:58.700 --> 00:23:00.540
"Nothing to report"?!

340
00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:03.460
How dare you respond so nonchalantly?!

341
00:23:03.460 --> 00:23:06.350
The pirates are headed your way!

342
00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:09.920
<b>Eastern Port</b>

343
00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:10.190
Oh no, sir, it's quite peaceful out here.

344
00:23:10.190 --> 00:23:13.330
We don't need any more backup, over!

345
00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:14.680
You...

346
00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:17.750
State your names and Marine codes.

347
00:23:18.140 --> 00:23:19.720
Sir?

348
00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:22.000
Oh, ummm...

349
00:23:22.980 --> 00:23:24.840
Dammit all!

350
00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:29.340
The eastern port has been seized!
Send reinforcements east!

351
00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:30.020
Yes, sir!

352
00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:32.730
<b>Bartolomeo's Group</b>

353
00:23:33.700 --> 00:23:36.180
Go on ahead, straight to the port!

354
00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:37.600
Thanks!

355
00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:42.560
Don't waste my time by telling me how grateful you are!

356
00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:50.240
Debt upon debt!
We already have far too much to repay!

357
00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:52.820
I-I-Is that a roadblock ahead?

358
00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:03.350
Go!

359
00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:04.830
Thanks!

360
00:24:16.920 --> 00:24:19.720
Th-The criminals that were supposed to be at the Palace...

361
00:24:19.720 --> 00:24:22.090
have appeared in the ruins of the eastern town!

362
00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:22.560
What?!

363
00:24:22.940 --> 00:24:25.480
So is the Palace empty?!

364
00:24:28.520 --> 00:24:30.190
We're in front of the Palace!

365
00:24:32.580 --> 00:24:34.500
S-Straw Hat is...

366
00:24:35.600 --> 00:24:37.910
Rubber Rubber..

367
00:24:38.760 --> 00:24:40.400
Fireworks!

368
00:24:53.620 --> 00:24:56.820
<b>Flower Field
Outside the Palace</b>

369
00:24:55.160 --> 00:24:57.400
Rebecca!

370
00:24:57.400 --> 00:25:00.270
Rebecca! Where are you?!

371
00:25:04.100 --> 00:25:06.900
Why is Straw Hat in front of the Palace?!

372
00:25:08.400 --> 00:25:10.340
You had better not let him get away!

373
00:25:10.340 --> 00:25:10.690
Yes, sir!

374
00:25:10.690 --> 00:25:13.700
Rebecca!

375
00:25:15.140 --> 00:25:19.370
Hey, Rebecca!

376
00:25:20.900 --> 00:25:22.620
Somebody's calling for me!

377
00:25:25.780 --> 00:25:27.300
Lucy?!

378
00:25:27.300 --> 00:25:30.420
Lucy! I'm up here!

379
00:25:30.850 --> 00:25:33.000
Lucy!

380
00:25:35.060 --> 00:25:38.730
You mustn't, Rebecca-sama!
You shouldn't be talking to a pirate!

381
00:25:38.730 --> 00:25:40.140
There she is!

382
00:25:41.350 --> 00:25:42.760
<b>Palace
Courtyard</b>

383
00:25:41.900 --> 00:25:42.770
Tank.

384
00:25:43.420 --> 00:25:46.540
Would you fetch Viola and Rebecca?

385
00:25:46.540 --> 00:25:47.320
At once.

386
00:25:48.140 --> 00:25:49.860
Let's go down into the town.

387
00:25:50.420 --> 00:25:54.960
We shall declare to the nation
the return of the Riku Family to the throne.

388
00:25:56.140 --> 00:25:57.630
Yes, right away!

389
00:25:57.630 --> 00:26:00.340
I have been looking forward to this moment for so long!

390
00:26:00.340 --> 00:26:03.200
Rebecca!

391
00:26:04.520 --> 00:26:05.980
Lucy!

392
00:26:07.880 --> 00:26:08.840
Lucy!

393
00:26:08.840 --> 00:26:10.650
Straw Hat! What are you doing here?

394
00:26:21.580 --> 00:26:23.300
Please stand back, Rebecca-sama!

395
00:26:24.260 --> 00:26:25.230
Lucy!

396
00:26:25.570 --> 00:26:28.980
I'm so glad!
I really wanted to thank you...

397
00:26:29.320 --> 00:26:30.240
Shut up!

398
00:26:31.300 --> 00:26:33.200
I ain't here for that!

399
00:26:34.200 --> 00:26:36.120
Are you really sure?!

400
00:26:37.060 --> 00:26:38.240
About the soldier?!

401
00:26:39.280 --> 00:26:41.280
You'll never see him again!

402
00:26:44.220 --> 00:26:48.810
Lucy... I received a letter from him.

403
00:26:52.880 --> 00:26:58.480
Soldier-san is trying his best to distance himself from me.

404
00:27:03.320 --> 00:27:06.580
He's trying to make me a stranger.

405
00:27:07.900 --> 00:27:11.020
Quit talking like you're my father!

406
00:27:14.840 --> 00:27:15.780
Why is that?

407
00:27:16.960 --> 00:27:18.620
Is it because I was mean to him?

408
00:27:20.400 --> 00:27:22.950
There's no way you can beat Doflamingo!

409
00:27:23.340 --> 00:27:27.250
You're just a one-legged toy!

410
00:27:36.020 --> 00:27:39.440
Does he just not want to live with me?

411
00:27:44.960 --> 00:27:46.600
Am I just a nuisance?

412
00:27:46.600 --> 00:27:49.180
How would I know?! Think for yourself!

413
00:27:49.180 --> 00:27:51.880
I gotta get out of this country right now!

414
00:27:52.520 --> 00:27:55.880
I only came here to ask if you were okay leaving things like this!

415
00:27:57.860 --> 00:27:59.150
Of course I'm not!

416
00:27:59.470 --> 00:28:01.780
I don't want this!

417
00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:03.620
Then you wanna come with me?

418
00:28:04.440 --> 00:28:06.300
Yeah, let's go!

419
00:28:07.440 --> 00:28:09.450
What? Rebecca-sama...

420
00:28:09.860 --> 00:28:11.960
Rebecca, Straw Hat! Please wait!

421
00:28:13.080 --> 00:28:14.220
Viola-san!

422
00:28:15.200 --> 00:28:16.360
I have a favor to ask!

423
00:28:18.460 --> 00:28:19.460
We're outta here!

424
00:28:26.640 --> 00:28:28.800
Hang on tight!

425
00:28:28.800 --> 00:28:29.680
Got it!

426
00:28:30.640 --> 00:28:31.600
He's escaping!

427
00:28:31.980 --> 00:28:33.800
My king!

428
00:28:34.940 --> 00:28:35.860
What's the matter?

429
00:28:36.180 --> 00:28:40.220
Rebecca-sama has been kidnapped by a pirate!

430
00:28:40.220 --> 00:28:42.130
What did you say?

431
00:28:42.130 --> 00:28:45.420
What pirate from where?! What did he look like?!

432
00:28:45.420 --> 00:28:47.960
Was it one of the competitors from the Colosseum?!

433
00:28:47.960 --> 00:28:51.250
S-St-Straw...

434
00:28:51.250 --> 00:28:52.910
It was Straw Hat Luffy!

435
00:28:55.120 --> 00:28:59.190
Rebecca-sama has been abducted from the Palace!

436
00:28:59.190 --> 00:29:01.670
Straw Hat Luffy did it!

437
00:29:01.670 --> 00:29:03.070
You're kidding!

438
00:29:03.070 --> 00:29:05.320
He's gotta be holding her for ransom!

439
00:29:07.130 --> 00:29:09.860
I can't believe Lucy did that!

440
00:29:09.860 --> 00:29:11.930
How audacious!

441
00:29:12.280 --> 00:29:14.620
Even so...

442
00:29:14.620 --> 00:29:15.940
I still...

443
00:29:17.080 --> 00:29:19.910
like ya!

444
00:29:19.910 --> 00:29:21.530
What are you talking about, Gatz?!

445
00:29:22.020 --> 00:29:26.490
See?! This is what happens when you place your trust in pirates and allow them safe harbor!

446
00:29:26.490 --> 00:29:30.500
Capture Straw Hat as quickly as possible
and rescue Princess Rebecca!

447
00:29:40.740 --> 00:29:41.480
There he is!

448
00:29:42.320 --> 00:29:45.140
Special sniper unit.
Take aim and shoot him down!

449
00:30:02.260 --> 00:30:04.320
The Marines just suddenly...

450
00:30:04.420 --> 00:30:06.460
<b>Naval Tent</b>

451
00:30:04.940 --> 00:30:06.490
Our men collapsed?

452
00:30:06.890 --> 00:30:08.410
Was it Conqueror's Haki?

453
00:30:08.410 --> 00:30:10.820
Negative, sir, they seem to still be conscious...

454
00:30:11.580 --> 00:30:15.250
Well, whatever it was,
they're going to escape from the eastern port!

455
00:30:15.720 --> 00:30:20.640
Send warships as well!
All units, head east for Carta!

456
00:30:20.640 --> 00:30:21.250
Yes, sir!

457
00:30:23.300 --> 00:30:24.920
Oh, there he is!

458
00:30:25.660 --> 00:30:26.960
Stop!

459
00:30:33.940 --> 00:30:36.060
Catch Lucy!

460
00:30:39.440 --> 00:30:41.360
Catch this!

461
00:30:54.110 --> 00:30:55.830
Whoa! What's going on?!

462
00:30:55.830 --> 00:30:57.030
Lucy?!

463
00:30:57.030 --> 00:30:58.330
That's my meat!

464
00:30:58.330 --> 00:30:58.870
I'm sorry!

465
00:31:03.900 --> 00:31:04.540
Rebecca!

466
00:31:06.230 --> 00:31:09.300
I'll leave you behind the hill and lure them away.

467
00:31:10.020 --> 00:31:11.010
The rest is on you!

468
00:31:11.800 --> 00:31:14.030
The whole nation is trying to protect you.

469
00:31:14.030 --> 00:31:16.390
If you're caught, they'll take you back to the Palace.

470
00:31:19.540 --> 00:31:21.280
Okay, I got it!

471
00:31:22.080 --> 00:31:25.320
You better hurry or he'll be gone.

472
00:31:25.320 --> 00:31:26.610
Thank you.

473
00:31:26.920 --> 00:31:29.360
Thank you for everything, Lucy!

474
00:31:31.600 --> 00:31:33.280
Sure, don't mention it!

475
00:31:56.340 --> 00:31:58.660
You're such a cutie...

476
00:31:59.840 --> 00:32:01.460
You're crying again.

477
00:32:11.560 --> 00:32:12.660
Scarlett...

478
00:32:13.880 --> 00:32:15.760
I've fulfilled my duty.

479
00:32:16.980 --> 00:32:20.360
Forgive me for lying about not being your other half.

480
00:32:22.100 --> 00:32:26.220
I did it all so that Rebecca can live a happy life.

481
00:32:52.300 --> 00:32:54.160
I'm gonna teach you how to fight.

482
00:32:54.820 --> 00:32:57.830
Mother said that it's bad to hurt people.

483
00:32:58.700 --> 00:33:01.910
I'm teaching you this so that you don't get hurt.

484
00:33:04.170 --> 00:33:05.880
On your feet, Rebecca!

485
00:33:05.880 --> 00:33:06.880
Be strong!

486
00:33:07.620 --> 00:33:11.020
Because you were a member of the royal family, you've had to flee from place to place,

487
00:33:11.600 --> 00:33:13.200
and endured endless scorn for a decade.

488
00:33:13.870 --> 00:33:16.320
That's why, this time...

489
00:33:17.240 --> 00:33:21.360
I want you to have your chance at happiness
as a member of the royal family.

490
00:33:24.920 --> 00:33:27.640
I can't stay here, either.

491
00:33:33.940 --> 00:33:34.700
Rebecca!

492
00:33:39.780 --> 00:33:41.870
Don't go making up lies!

493
00:33:45.360 --> 00:33:47.340
Oh, is this about the letter?

494
00:33:48.350 --> 00:33:49.470
I wasn't lying!

495
00:33:50.060 --> 00:33:55.580
In the past, I really was just some
worthless guy who did nothing but fight.

496
00:33:56.770 --> 00:33:58.450
And whatever my reasons may have been...

497
00:33:59.820 --> 00:34:02.220
the fact is, I did kill.

498
00:34:02.770 --> 00:34:03.980
So that's why...

499
00:34:08.350 --> 00:34:11.730
I'm not the daughter of some prince!

500
00:34:13.300 --> 00:34:15.220
I don't know anyone like that!

501
00:34:19.760 --> 00:34:24.720
It doesn't matter if he killed hundreds of people
or how tainted his hands are.

502
00:34:25.880 --> 00:34:28.080
I only have one father!

503
00:34:29.660 --> 00:34:32.820
I'm the daughter of Kyros!

504
00:34:42.280 --> 00:34:44.360
So don't go making up lies!

505
00:34:47.180 --> 00:34:50.760
Until the day you can find true happiness,

506
00:34:51.580 --> 00:34:53.580
I'll always be by your side.

507
00:35:02.360 --> 00:35:05.440
Stay by my side like you promised, Soldier-san!

508
00:35:14.120 --> 00:35:18.170
Y-You're fine with me being your father?

509
00:35:19.680 --> 00:35:23.980
Yeah! Let's live together!

510
00:35:25.110 --> 00:35:26.600
Father!

511
00:35:27.380 --> 00:35:29.400
Yeah... Yeah!

512
00:35:40.140 --> 00:35:43.580
Rebecca will not be returning to the Palace, Father.

513
00:35:44.500 --> 00:35:47.080
Viola... I thought as much.

514
00:35:47.440 --> 00:35:50.870
Indeed. That's what she wants.

515
00:35:51.280 --> 00:35:54.710
I'm sorry, Viola-san, but could you
take my place and become princess?

516
00:35:58.800 --> 00:36:01.920
I'm sorry, Viola, but could you
take my place and become princess?

517
00:36:01.920 --> 00:36:03.100
Sister?

518
00:36:04.440 --> 00:36:08.740
This is the second time in my life that someone has asked me for such an odd favor.

519
00:36:08.740 --> 00:36:11.390
I see. Like mother, like daughter.

520
00:36:12.280 --> 00:36:13.620
Luffy still isn't here?

521
